he artist.","cap":"<figcaption>\n<p>Image © Pedro Wainer. From the series “Desentierros”<em> #4</em>. <em>Perfil</em> .107cm x 200 cm. Silver Gelatin Print, 2017. Courtesy of the artist.</p>\n</figcaption>","w":2293,"h":1127,"href":null,"fp":"0.5,0.5"}]}]}]}]},{"t":"hr"},{"t":"row","cols":[{"span":4,"blocks":[{"t":"text","html":"<p><strong>Finalists</strong> (US based artist): <br/>Kristine Thompson &amp; Kioto Aoki</p>"}]},{"span":4,"blocks":[{"t":"text","html":"<p><strong>Finalists </strong>(NYC based artists): <br/>Kaitlyn Danielson &amp; Lauren Orchowski</p>"}]},{"span":4,"blocks":[{"t":"text","html":"<p><strong>Finalists </strong>(International artists)<strong>: <br/></strong>Ella Morton &amp; Isa Benn</p>"}]}]},{"t":"hr"},{"t":"text","html":"<p>Members of the 2019 Jury:</p><p><strong>Alissa Schoendfeld</strong> (Director of Yossi Milo Gallery, New York City)<br/><strong>Marina Berio</strong> (Artist and Educator, Chair Emeritus of the General Studies Program at International Center of Photography, New York City)<br/><strong>Yamini Nayar</strong> (Artist. Represented by Thomas Erben, New York City; Wendi Norris, San Francisco; and Jhaveri Contemporary, Mumbai).</p>"},{"t":"hr"},{"t":"text","html":"<p>Scroll down to learn about the selected artists.</p>"}]}